  "h1": "Custom Drinkware with Lids for Bulk Orders",
  "metaTitle": "Custom Drinkware with Lids | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order custom drinkware with lids for your team or event. Perfect for hot and cold beverages. Get a quote at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>Lidded drinkware keeps beverages at the right temperature while preventing spills during commutes, meetings, or outdoor events. Whether you need insulated tumblers for corporate gifts or durable mugs for breakrooms, lids add convenience and reduce mess. Options like the 40 oz BrüMate Era and 16 oz Roadster Mug feature secure, leak-resistant lids that make them ideal for on-the-go use. Choose from stainless steel, plastic, or ceramic constructions and add your logo with screen printing or laser engraving for a professional look that stands up to daily use.</p>",
